        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: मतभेद",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मतभेद — matbhed — \"a disagreement\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "भावांमध्ये पैशांवरून मतभेद झाले. bhāvāmmadhye paiśāṁvarūn matbhed jhāle. The brothers disagreed over money."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Mostly plural: मतभेद (matbhed) होणे, to disagree; मत + भेद, opinion + split."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मतभेद (matbhed) is built from two tatsamas, Sanskrit mata, \"thought, opinion\", and bheda, \"splitting, difference\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for giving reasons and opinions."
            }
          ]
        },
