              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सहमत होणे — sahmat hoṇe — \"to agree\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मी तुमच्या मताशी सहमत आहे. mī tumacyā matāśī sahmat āhe. I agree with your view."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he …): तो सहमत झाला, to sahmat jhālā."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The person or view agreed with takes -शी: तुमच्याशी सहमत."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सहमत होणे (sahmat hoṇe) joins सहमत, built from Sanskrit saha, \"together\", and mata, \"opinion\" (Monier-Williams), to होणे, \"to become\"."
            }
          ]
        },
